  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvikyui14lc22c9c9ihzg61xx@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1920\" data-video-height=\"1080\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvikyui14lc22c9c9ihzg61xx/thumbs/4.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33225078385&amp;signature=wbg8WyeZa379HH6sN6MLG2SXBNw%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1920\" data-video-origin-height=\"1080\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvikyui14lc22c9c9ihzg61xx?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2aWt5dWkxNGxjMjJjOWM5aWh6ZzYxeHgiLCJ0aWQiOiJjMjc1OTgxNi05ZjFiLTQ0ZTAtODZhZC01ZWJiZTc2NWIzM2YiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODM5MjZ9.uDzhVqhL82BAvye3qDMZ2N2-0mB8X-IBsRv_2KNNQ0uLk-GtGeUutfIS-Op9QbdjPq11ExEDEBPp4e3W6Eyvtg&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">책에서는 소금을 너무 많이 뿌리면 과냉각 되니 주의하라고 했지만..말을 안들어 봅니다..ㅎㅎㅎ<br>엘사 빙의하며 과냉각 물이 순식간에 어는 모습을 보여주면 엄청 신기해 합니다. 학생들이 신기해하니 뿌듯하더라구요ㅎㅎ<br>첫번째 반에서는 6모둠 중 1모둠에서만 성공하였는데, 확실히 여러번하니까 스킬(?)이 늘어서 다섯번째 반에서는 6모둠 중 5모둠에서 성공시킬수 있었습니다.^^<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8bc03cdad759c7247455777cea6834415373d864\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8bc03cdad759c7247455777cea6834415373d864\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"402\"><div class=\"figcaption\">과냉각 물에 충격을 주기 직전 떨리는 순간</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2263b3cc65c43dcc703d20cdef1931a00df24e15\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2263b3cc65c43dcc703d20cdef1931a00df24e15\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"540\"><div class=\"figcaption\">-5도까지 버티는 중</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d76788b5658ad3e06da8676d00eb68f9b8847f05\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d76788b5658ad3e06da8676d00eb68f9b8847f05\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"540\"><div class=\"figcaption\">시간측정관(?)과 기록관(?)</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f9bc0cb4bb805282592edd59eb2ab37b81f1b985\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f9bc0cb4bb805282592edd59eb2ab37b81f1b985\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"540\"><div class=\"figcaption\">같은 재료, 같은 실험인데 모둠별로 온도와 진행 상태가 다 다름..</div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>물의 응고와 얼음의 융해를 관찰하는 실험을 하고 싶었는데,<br>학교에 스탠드가 없어서 고민하던 찰나!<br>김신혜(부산) 선생님의 디지털 온도계와 일회용 스포이트 아이디어 덕분에 손쉽게 실험 진행할 수 있었습니다^^(역시 없는게 없다는 재과만&#128077;)<br>&lt;재료&gt;<br>-디지털 온도계<br>-일회용 스포이트<br>-비커<br>-소금<br>-초시계(없어도 무방)<br><br>&lt;과냉각 물 조건&gt;<br>- 얼음에 소금 충분히 넣어주기(중간에 얼음 빈 곳 생기면 얼음도 더 보충해주기)<br>- 궁금해도 건드리지 말고 -5~6도까지 버티기(-4도에서도 잘 안될때 있었음)<br>- 과냉각된 물 들어올릴때 조심히 빼기(빼다가 얼어버리기도 함)<br><br><br>&lt;탐구 활동지&gt;<br>비상 교과서 탐구 활동지 수정함. (실험방법 및 과냉각 내용 추가)<br></p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/35c752d636f93fe1ad0b79783635256817da3893\" data-file-name=\"중1_과학_물의 응고, 얼음의 융해(+과냉각) 탐구 활동지.hwp\" data-file-size=\"602624\" data-mimetype=\"application/x-hwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D186%26fileid%3D8%26regdt%3D20221111212627&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F35c752d636f93fe1ad0b79783635256817da3893')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">중1_과학_물의 응고, 얼음의 융해(+과냉각) 탐구 활동지</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">588.50KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d579d77513519660826671de1db4ef8b402817d9\" data-file-name=\"(교사용)중1_과학_물의 응고, 얼음의 융해(+과냉각) 탐구 활동지 (1).hwp\" data-file-size=\"667648\" data-mimetype=\"application/x-hwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D186%26fileid%3D10%26regdt%3D20221111212627&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fd579d77513519660826671de1db4ef8b402817d9')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">(교사용)중1_과학_물의 응고, 얼음의 융해(+과냉각) 탐구 활동지 (1)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">652.00KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br>&lt;마지막에 보여주면 좋을 영상&gt;<br><a href=\"https://youtu.be/rueQ2moBPDQ\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/rueQ2moBPDQ</a><br></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rueQ2moBPDQ\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1280\" data-video-height=\"720\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/yBvrT/hyQwDN0Hla/rhsxi1VSn4ypeRn1gvkiJk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1280\" data-video-origin-height=\"720\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rueQ2moBPDQ\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
